s=k.AA(a,A.k('WrindhaOS is a productivity and study-management application built for students preparing for competitive examinations such as NEET, JEE, and UPSC. WrindhaOS is developed and operated by WrindhaOS ("we," "us," "our," or the "Company"), based in Chittoor, Andhra Pradesh, India.\n\nWrindhaOS was created to give exam aspirants a single workspace for the discipline that competitive preparation demands \u2014 habit tracking, subject and topic mastery tracking, a goals hierarchy, an Eisenhower-style priority matrix, a calendar and timetable, a private journal, a focus/study timer, and lightweight personal expense tracking \u2014 instead of juggling five different apps.',j,j,j,j,A.w(j,j,i?B.al:B.a8,j,j,j,j,j,j,j,j,13.5,j,j,j,j,1.6,!0,j,j,j,j,j,j,j,j),j,j,j),B.PX,i,"1","Who We Are")
